  "sections": [
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0001",
      "text": "FCCPS AI Advisory Committee – Meeting 4"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0002",
      "text": "Chair Sheet (Run-of-Show – 60 Minutes)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0003",
      "text": "Goal:\nAdopt policy principles → hear workstream briefings → seed recommendations outline + risk register."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0004",
      "text": "0:00–0:02"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0005",
      "text": "Call to Order / Agenda Adoption"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0006",
      "text": "Script\n“Good morning. Our goal today is convergence: adopt policy principles, hear four workstream briefings, and identify the key risks that will shape the recommendations outline.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0007",
      "text": "Motion:\nAdopt agenda"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0008",
      "text": "0:02–0:05"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0009",
      "text": "Approve Minutes (Meeting 3)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0010",
      "text": "Motion\nApprove minutes"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0011",
      "text": "If corrections arise:\n“Noted. We’ll incorporate that edit.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0012",
      "text": "0:05–0:10"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0013",
      "text": "Public Comment"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0014",
      "text": "Chair reminder\n“We welcome brief comments. Please limit to two minutes.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0015",
      "text": "0:10–0:15"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0016",
      "text": "Liaison Remarks"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0017",
      "text": "Hard stop if needed."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0018",
      "text": "“Thank you. We’ll now move to the main agenda.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0019",
      "text": "0:15–0:25"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0020",
      "text": "Policy Principles Adoption"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0021",
      "text": "Chair framing"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0022",
      "text": "“Over the past week the committee reviewed and reconciled the proposed policy principles. The question before us today is whether this set is sufficient to guide drafting.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0023",
      "text": "Process"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0024",
      "text": "Chair recap (2 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0025",
      "text": "Clarifying comments only (3 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0026",
      "text": "Motion to adopt (5 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0027",
      "text": "Control phrase if debate expands"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0028",
      "text": "“We can capture additional views in writing. Today we’re deciding whether this set is sufficient to guide drafting.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0029",
      "text": "0:25–0:41"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0030",
      "text": "Workstream Briefings (16 minutes)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0031",
      "text": "Each briefing = 3 min presentation + 1 min clarification"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0032",
      "text": "Chair reminder"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0033",
      "text": "“To keep us on time, each workstream has four minutes total.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0034",
      "text": "WS-POL (4 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0035",
      "text": "Focus\nPolicy skeleton + decision points"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0036",
      "text": "Expected outputs"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0037",
      "text": "• one-sentence summary\n• key constraints\n• policy decision gates"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0038",
      "text": "WS-CPX (4 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0039",
      "text": "Focus\nScenario bank"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0040",
      "text": "Expected outputs"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0041",
      "text": "• classroom patterns\n• edge cases\n• implications for policy"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0042",
      "text": "WS-AIN (4 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0043",
      "text": "Focus\nIntegrity / attribution matrix"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0044",
      "text": "Expected outputs"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0045",
      "text": "• assessment expectations\n• safeguards\n• attribution rules"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0046",
      "text": "WS-EQA (4 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0047",
      "text": "Focus\nEquity impact checklist"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0048",
      "text": "Expected outputs"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0049",
      "text": "• equity review criteria\n• potential equity risks"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0050",
      "text": "Chair control phrase if speakers run long"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0051",
      "text": "“Please move to your final point.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0052",
      "text": "0:41–0:56"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0053",
      "text": "Risk Register Seeding"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0054",
      "text": "Chair opening"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0055",
      "text": "“We are not solving risks today. We are identifying them.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0056",
      "text": "Process"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0057",
      "text": "Chair summarizes risks from workstreams (3 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0058",
      "text": "Round-robin\nEach member may name one risk (6 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0059",
      "text": "Chair clusters risks live (implementation / integrity / equity / governance) (5 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0060",
      "text": "Confirm synthesis owner (2 min)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0061",
      "text": "Rules"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0062",
      "text": "• One risk per person\n• No rebuttal first pass\n• Mitigation discussion deferred"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0063",
      "text": "Control phrase (use often)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0064",
      "text": "“That’s helpful — let’s capture it as a risk.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0065",
      "text": "0:56–1:00"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0066",
      "text": "Next Steps"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0067",
      "text": "Confirm"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0068",
      "text": "• risk register synthesis owner\n• integration timeline\n• Meeting 5 preparation"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0069",
      "text": "Script"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0070",
      "text": "“With these inputs, the recommendations outline and risk register can now be synthesized ahead of our next checkpoint.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0071",
      "text": "Adjourn."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [],
      "section_id": "sec_0072",
      "text": "Quick Timer Reference"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0073",
      "text": "Use one of these lines:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0074",
      "text": "Redirect"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0075",
      "text": "“Let’s capture that and keep moving.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0076",
      "text": "De-escalate"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0077",
      "text": "“That’s a drafting question rather than a meeting decision.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0078",
      "text": "Protect time"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0079",
      "text": "“We need to hear from the other workstreams.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0080",
      "text": "If you'd like, I can also give you three “chair moves” that experienced public-body chairs use to prevent one analytical voice from taking over the meeting, which might be useful given the personalities in this committee."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0081",
      "text": "Yes, please."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0082",
      "text": "Here are three chair moves that experienced public-body chairs use to keep a meeting productive when one strong analytical voice (or any member) starts to dominate discussion. Each move preserves respect and transparency while protecting the group’s time and balance. ⚖️"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0083",
      "text": "Purpose: Prevent long analytical arguments while still validating the point."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0084",
      "text": "How it works"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0085",
      "text": "Listen for ~10–15 seconds."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0086",
      "text": "Translate the comment into a concise summary."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0087",
      "text": "Capture it in the record (risk, constraint, or drafting note)."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0088",
      "text": "Move on."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0089",
      "text": "Script"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0090",
      "text": "“Let me translate that to make sure I’ve got it. You’re raising a concern that [short summary]. Let’s capture that as a risk/constraint and keep moving.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0091",
      "text": "Why it works"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0092",
      "text": "The speaker feels heard."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0093",
      "text": "The committee sees the idea recorded."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "1. The “Translate and Park” Move"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0094",
      "text": "The discussion does not spiral."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0095",
      "text": "Purpose: Stop a single voice from monopolizing discussion without calling them out."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0096",
      "text": "How it works\nSwitch to structured participation."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0097",
      "text": "Script"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0098",
      "text": "“Let’s do a quick round-robin so we can hear from everyone. One brief comment per member.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0099",
      "text": "Rules:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0100",
      "text": "One comment"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0101",
      "text": "No rebuttals first pass"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0102",
      "text": "10–15 seconds each"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0103",
      "text": "Why it works"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0104",
      "text": "Instantly redistributes airtime."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0105",
      "text": "Prevents debate loops."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "2. The “Equal Air-Time Reset”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0106",
      "text": "Gives quieter members space."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "3. The “Decision Gate Clarifier”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0107",
      "text": "Purpose: Prevent theoretical discussion when the meeting only needs a decision."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "3. The “Decision Gate Clarifier”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0108",
      "text": "How it works\nRestate the exact decision in front of the committee."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "3. The “Decision Gate Clarifier”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0109",
      "text": "Script"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "3. The “Decision Gate Clarifier”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0110",
      "text": "“The question before us is simply whether this is sufficient to guide drafting. We’re not deciding every policy detail today.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "3. The “Decision Gate Clarifier”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0111",
      "text": "or"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "3. The “Decision Gate Clarifier”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0112",
      "text": "“This is a drafting question, not a meeting decision. Let’s note it and move forward.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "3. The “Decision Gate Clarifier”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0113",
      "text": "Why it works"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "3. The “Decision Gate Clarifier”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0114",
      "text": "Refocuses the group on the decision gate."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "3. The “Decision Gate Clarifier”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0115",
      "text": "Stops philosophical debate."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "The Most Powerful Line a Chair Can Use"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0116",
      "text": "Use this often tomorrow:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "The Most Powerful Line a Chair Can Use"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0117",
      "text": "“Let’s capture that and keep moving.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "The Most Powerful Line a Chair Can Use"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0118",
      "text": "It signals:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "The Most Powerful Line a Chair Can Use"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0119",
      "text": "respect"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "The Most Powerful Line a Chair Can Use"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0120",
      "text": "documentation"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "The Most Powerful Line a Chair Can Use"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0121",
      "text": "forward momentum"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "Bonus Move (When Someone Is Truly Running Long)"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0122",
      "text": "The Gentle Interruption"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "Bonus Move (When Someone Is Truly Running Long)"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0123",
      "text": "Wait for a natural breath and say:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "Bonus Move (When Someone Is Truly Running Long)"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0124",
      "text": "“I’m going to pause you there so we can stay on time.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "Bonus Move (When Someone Is Truly Running Long)"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0125",
      "text": "Then immediately transition."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "Bonus Move (When Someone Is Truly Running Long)"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0126",
      "text": "This is standard practice in board facilitation and rarely offends when done neutrally."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "A Hidden Advantage You Have Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0127",
      "text": "Your process structure is already doing most of the work:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "A Hidden Advantage You Have Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0128",
      "text": "4-minute workstream briefs"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "A Hidden Advantage You Have Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0129",
      "text": "round-robin risk capture"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "A Hidden Advantage You Have Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0130",
      "text": "decision gates"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "A Hidden Advantage You Have Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0131",
      "text": "That structure naturally limits dominance."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "A Hidden Advantage You Have Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0132",
      "text": "Your job tomorrow is mostly tempo control, not persuasion."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "A Hidden Advantage You Have Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0133",
      "text": "Here is the advanced chair technique that works particularly well with highly analytical dissenters (people like David or Tom who think deeply, speak precisely, and can expand discussion if given open floor)."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "A Hidden Advantage You Have Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0134",
      "text": "This technique is sometimes called “Structured Containment with Honor.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "If Discussion Starts Sprawling",
        "A Hidden Advantage You Have Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0135",
      "text": "It lets you use their analytical strength without letting it dominate the meeting."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0136",
      "text": "The idea"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0137",
      "text": "Give the analytical voice a specific moment and role, rather than letting analysis emerge unpredictably."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0138",
      "text": "Instead of suppressing them, you channel them."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0139",
      "text": "How You Use It Tomorrow"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0140",
      "text": "When you reach a decision or risk point, say something like:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0141",
      "text": "“Before we move forward, I’d like to give David one analytical pass to flag anything that would break this approach in practice.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0142",
      "text": "Then give 20–30 seconds maximum."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Why This Works"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0143",
      "text": "Analytical members often speak repeatedly because they fear something important will be missed."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Why This Works"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0144",
      "text": "When you explicitly assign them the role of “stress tester,” three things happen:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Why This Works"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0145",
      "text": "They feel respected."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Why This Works"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0146",
      "text": "They concentrate their analysis."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Why This Works"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0147",
      "text": "They speak once instead of multiple times."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Why This Works"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0148",
      "text": "After they speak, you close the loop:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Why This Works"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0149",
      "text": "“Good. Let’s capture that as a risk and move forward.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0150",
      "text": "After Principles Adoption"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0151",
      "text": "If someone hesitates:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0152",
      "text": "“David, quick analytical check — does anything here break in practice?”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0153",
      "text": "After WS-POL briefing"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0154",
      "text": "Policy thinkers often expand here."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0155",
      "text": "“Tom, quick governance check — anything here that wouldn’t survive implementation?”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0156",
      "text": "During Risk Register"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0157",
      "text": "If debate starts:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0158",
      "text": "“Let’s give one analytical pass before we cluster risks.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0159",
      "text": "The Key Rule"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0160",
      "text": "The analytical pass must be:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0161",
      "text": "Short\nSingle turn\nThen closed"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0162",
      "text": "If they continue:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0163",
      "text": "“That’s helpful — let’s capture that and keep moving.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0164",
      "text": "Why This Works Especially Well in Your Committee"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0165",
      "text": "Your group has several “precision thinkers.”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0166",
      "text": "Without structure they will:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0167",
      "text": "refine language"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0168",
      "text": "explore edge cases"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0169",
      "text": "reopen definitions"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0170",
      "text": "Those behaviors are valuable during drafting, but dangerous during convergence meetings."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0171",
      "text": "This technique allows you to extract the value without losing tempo."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0172",
      "text": "A Subtle Psychological Benefit"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0173",
      "text": "When analytical voices are acknowledged early:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0174",
      "text": "They are much less likely to interrupt later."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0175",
      "text": "They feel their role has been recognized."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0176",
      "text": "One More Move (Extremely Powerful)"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0177",
      "text": "Near the end of a topic, say:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0178",
      "text": "“Are there any new concerns we haven’t already captured?”"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0179",
      "text": "The word new prevents repetition."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0180",
      "text": "The Chair Mindset for Tomorrow"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0181",
      "text": "Your job is not to win arguments."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0182",
      "text": "Your job is to maintain:"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0183",
      "text": "tempo\nfairness\nforward motion"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0184",
      "text": "Think of yourself as an air traffic controller for ideas."
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0185",
      "text": "Planes land.\nThey don’t circle indefinitely. ✈️"
    },
    {
      "heading_path": [
        "The Technique: “Designated Analytical Pass”",
        "Where to Use It Tomorrow"
      ],
      "section_id": "sec_0186",
      "text": "| Time | Segment |\n| --- | --- |\n| 0:00 | Call to order |\n| 0:15 | Principles adoption |\n| 0:25 | Workstream briefings |\n| 0:41 | Risk register |\n| 0:56 | Next steps |\n| 1:00 | Adjourn |"
    }
  ],
  "source_hash_sha256": "49fb538e5f91875c3055129496761f531a0eeb009fdf15e35d2ac418d91342ba",
